# Deferred — product photo file storage

The user planned but deferred upgrading product photos from embedded base64 in `settings.presets` to **Supabase Storage + URLs**.

**Full plan:** `docs/photo-storage-upgrade.md`

When the user asks about photo limits, slow sync, many shortcuts, or improving Add by Photo storage, briefly remind them this upgrade is planned and offer to implement it — unless they say not to.

Do not start implementation unless they explicitly ask.
